wipe Right → Next Slide
Point index finger and flick right to advance to next slide/page
👈
Swipe Left → Previous Slide
Point index finger and flick left to go back
✊
Fist → Pause / Blank Screen
Close fist to black out the screen (presenter pause moment)
🖐️
Open Palm → Resume
Open hand to bring the slide back
🤏
Pinch In/Out → Zoom
Pinch gesture to zoom into a specific area of the slide
👍
Thumbs Up → Laser Pointer ON
Activate a red laser dot that follows your fingertip on screen
✌️
Peace Sign → Draw Mode
Switch to annotation/draw mode — finger becomes a pen
🤟
3 Fingers → Erase Last Annotation
Undo the last drawn annotation instantly
✏️
Air Pen / Freehand Draw
Index finger tip tracked as pen — draw circles, underlines, arrows on PDF in real time
🖊️
Highlighter Mode
Switch to semi-transparent yellow stroke — highlight text on the PDF page
🔲
Shape Stamp — Box / Circle / Arrow
Gesture shortcut to drop a pre-drawn shape (rectangle, circle, arrow) on the slide
🗑️
Clear All Annotations
Wipe gesture (flat hand sweep left) clears all drawings on current page
💾
Save Annotated PDF
Export the current PDF with all annotations baked in as a downloadable file
🎨
Color Switcher
On-screen palette: red, blue, green, black — click or gesture to switch pen color
↩️
Undo / Redo
Standard undo stack — remove last stroke without clearing everything
🔴
Live Laser Pointer
Glowing red dot follows your fingertip across the projected slide in real time
📸
Snap Slide to Image
Screenshot any slide as PNG with one gesture — auto-saved to downloads
⏱️
Presentation Timer Overlay
Floating countdown timer so presenter knows time left — gesture to start/stop
🌙
Dark / Light Mode Toggle
Switch PDF viewer between dark and light mode mid-presentation
📷
Webcam Pip (Picture-in-Picture)
Show presenter's webcam feed in a small corner — great for virtual presentations
🗺️
Slide Thumbnail Strip
Bottom bar shows all PDF pages as thumbnails — jump to any page by pointing at it

